        truths: ("Four names on the payroll never worked at the warehouse, and the deposits went to {DL}'s spouse's account.", "The agency's invoice shows the names came from them, so {DL} acted on that."),
        defendant: [.direct("Did you pay workers who did not exist?", "\"No. I paid names from an agency's invoice, and I assumed they were real workers.\""), .direct("Where did the agency's names come from?", "\"The agency sent a list of temporary workers and an invoice. I entered them as instructed.\""), .direct("Why did the deposits go to your spouse's account?", "\"The agency asked to be paid through a third party. My spouse was the only account I could name quickly, and I passed the money along.\""), .direct("What did your spouse do with the money?", "\"Sent it to the agency's bank, as I understand it. I have the confirmations.\""), .direct("What did you do when the audit came?", "\"I gave the controller the invoice and the agency's contact. I was surprised the names didn't check out.\""), .direct("Do you have the invoice?", "\"Yes, I gave a copy to the controller. It lists the names and amounts.\""), .cross("You have been in this court before, haven't you?", "\"Yes, and I know how that colors things. I did not steal.\""), .cross("You approved the payments yourself, didn't you?", "\"Yes, as part of my job. I should have checked the names.\""), .cross("The agency can't be reached, can it?", "\"That's what I'm told. It may have closed.\""), .cross("Your spouse's account received the money, didn't it?", "\"Yes, and I should not have used it.\""), .cross("The workers never had time cards, did they?", "\"I didn't notice, and I should have.\"")],
